  token_estimate=3400
  boilerplate_ratio=0.18
  table_parse_success=0.92
  evidence_coverage=0.97

retrieval:
  top5_recall_before=0.58
  top5_recall_after=0.79</code></pre>
<p>This is the kind of output that turns “conversion quality” into something you can monitor like latency or error rate.</p>

